WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.299 --> 00:00:06.260
What happens when a copy of a video game and
a USB drive of manga are placed in SCP-914?

00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:12.640
Dr. Tiori selected a copy of "The Elder Scrolls
V: Skyrim" and a USB drive containing the

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:17.789
entirety of the manga "Jojo’s Bizarre Adventure
Part 5: Vento Aureo" for testing.

00:00:17.789 --> 00:00:21.640
First, the video game was placed inside on
the setting "1:1."

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:24.960
The output produced was a copy of "The Elder
Scrolls IV: Oblivion."

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:28.820
Next, the USB drive was placed inside on the
setting "Fine."

00:00:28.820 --> 00:00:33.190
The output was one USB drive containing an
animated adaptation of “Jojo’s Bizarre

00:00:33.190 --> 00:00:38.829
Adventure Part 5: Vento Aureo” with English
subtitles - years before the real adaptation

00:00:38.829 --> 00:00:39.829
came out.

00:00:39.829 --> 00:00:45.850
Dr. Tiori elected to keep the new USB drive
for herself, for research purposes only, of

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:46.390
course!

